   "text": "Cardiff University International Study Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCardiff University International Study Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCardiff University is a respected Russell Group university with a proud history of celebrating difference, located in the UK's most affordable student city. \nThe International Foundation Year is a three-term program preparing students for an undergraduate degree at Cardiff University. There are four routes to choose from, with sub-routes within them related to the chosen degree subject.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 10:40\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 10:40\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £23,981.68\nMin: £22,036.50\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n5%\n1,500 of 30,180 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1883\nCampus(es)\nCardiff\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6cZgjhQgrIY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
